  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.109 - cross-file and cross-project member syntax no longer crashes analysis\n - AM031 crashed following a comparer field/property declared in another file; AM030/AM033 crashed following a ConvertUsing Type member the same way\n - ForCtorParam analysis crashed binding a constructor declared in a referenced project (AM002/AM022)\n - Member syntax is now bound with the semantic model for its own tree, and foreign-compilation declarations fail closed\n - No rule ID or severity changes",
